tweets.text:
From the Nasdaq bell to the discussion that followed, one theme stood out: connecting BNB with US institutions and public capital markets.

@cz_binance, Core Contributor of BNB Chain, framed the opportunity as a connection between the crypto ecosystem and mainstream finance: “Now we're finally merging the two into what we call traditional financial assets, or people call it mainstream finance.” For tokenized real-world assets, he added: “I believe that's a huge market that requires mainstream finance integration.”

@thomasxchen, Chief Business Officer of BNB Chain, highlighted what investors see in BNB: Utility backed by market activity, citing over $6B in tokenized RWAs, $1.6B in tokenized stocks used in trading and lending, and $26B of trading volume in the last quarter. “So it shows that BNB Chain is not just the infrastructure, but providing the utility that traders as well as digital investors look for. The distribution and the market activity are here today on BNB Chain.”

@odagius, CEO of @BNBStandard, added that the next task is helping institutional investors understand the BNB ecosystem behind that exposure: “We're bringing that story to Wall Street. No one actually has properly looked at that to understand what the magnitude of that is.”

Alongside that effort, founders are building the financial products institutions could engage with. @ellazhang516, Managing Partner of @yzilabs, pointed to portfolio companies already developing structured financial products and AI applications, with regulation informing the investment approach: “And naturally we have to look into the regulations, how it evolves in order to form our investment thesis.”

The next chapter is connecting institutional access with the builders and products bringing BNB Chain into everyday finance.

BNB Street has a nice ring to it 🔔

@BNBStandard’s Nasdaq Opening Bell ceremony put BNB on a global financial stage, introducing a public-market route for US institutions to gain BNB treasury exposure through listed equity.

Relive the moment 👇
